WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.361
Before you buy land, you want to know what’s getting built around it.

00:00:04.561 --> 00:00:06.762
Tilly Land Planner reads it all for you.

00:00:07.813 --> 00:00:14.922
Tilly reads the council and committee records of all 444 Ontario municipalities.

00:00:15.121 --> 00:00:19.372
Zoning changes, severances, subdivisions and minor variances.

00:00:20.423 --> 00:00:24.057
Pick a town, and Tilly traces its real boundary on the map.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:30.513
Every application is a dot. Green was approved, red was declined, and blue is still proposed.

00:00:31.563 --> 00:00:34.797
Then Tilly writes a plain summary of what’s happening there.

00:00:34.997 --> 00:00:39.689
How much gets approved, the biggest projects, and what’s still waiting for a decision.

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:45.962
Open any application to see the address, what was asked for, the decision and the date.

00:00:46.162 --> 00:00:48.530
And how far it is from the land you’re looking at.

00:00:49.579 --> 00:00:52.799
See who’s applying, and the kinds of homes they propose.

00:00:52.999 --> 00:00:55.703
Detached homes, townhomes, and condos.

00:00:56.753 --> 00:01:01.722
Weighing two towns? Compare them side by side, and Tilly explains the difference.

00:01:02.772 --> 00:01:05.659
Free accounts get 5 property breakdowns a month.

00:01:05.859 --> 00:01:09.683
Tilly Premium takes the limits off, from $4.99 a month.

00:01:09.883 --> 00:01:11.924
Know what’s coming, before you buy.
